Application 26/01297/PPP is for four houses on land north of Kirk Brae. It was submitted as planning in principle, which sets out whether the site is suitable for development in general, without detailed designs.

The record shows the application has been **refused**, with a decision made on 9 September 2026. The consultation period is closed.

If you want to know the reasons for refusal or whether an appeal has been lodged, the decision notice on the council's planning register will have those details. I can also check the constraints for your address or the council's guidance if you're considering your own plans.
